    ('zn-kidde-120v-ac-worry-free-smoke-carbon-monoxide-alarm-with-10-year-sealed-in-battery-backup', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/products/13401-kgredSxT4-uA9H-PY9Q_800x.jpg?v=1677877458', 'Combined Smoke & Carbon Monoxide Alarm – A single unit can be installed where previously two were needed. Reduces installation time and protects against both fire and carbon monoxide dangers. Intelligent Sensor Technology – Combines the detection capabilities of a ionization smoke sensor with that of an electrochemical sensor which is used to detect CO. When either sensor notices a potential hazard the alarm will adjust its smoke sensitiivity to differentiate between a real hazard and a false one. Voice Warning – Announces the hazard type detected (in both English and French). Alarm announces “Fire! Fire!” when a smoke or fire hazard is detected and announces “Warning! Carbon Monoxide!” when a CO hazard is detected or “Low Battery!”. 120V Interconnectable – Will interconnect with up to 24 other devices (18 of which can be initiating) including smoke alarms (limit of 12) CO and heat alarms. Multi-function One Button Design includes: Hush® Feature – Temporarily silences nuisance alarms for approximately 9 minutes (smoke must be present before Hush® is activated). Test Feature – Simultaneously tests the unit’s electronics and verifies alarm operation. Reset Feature – Resets the carbon monoxide alarm Package Dimension: 160.00x160.00x60.00mm or6.3x6.3x2.4in Package Weight: 0.25kg or0.0lbs.'),
    ('zn-kidde-10-year-battery-worry-free-talking-smoke-and-carbon-monoxide-alarm', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/products/13400-ALDXTKRkX-f0UaNX1Dw_800x.jpg?v=1677877454', 'Combined Smoke & Carbon Monoxide Alarm – A single unit can be installed where previously two were needed. Reduces installation time and protects against both fire and carbon monoxide dangers. Intelligent Sensor Technology – Combines the detection capabilities of a photoelectric smoke sensor with that of an electrochemical sensor to better differentiate between a real hazard and a false one. Voice Warning – Announces the hazard type detected (in English and French). Multi-function One Button Design includes: Hush® Feature – Temporarily silences nuisance alarms for approximately 9 minutes (smoke must be present before Hush® is activated). Test Feature – Simultaneously tests the unit’s electronics and verifies alarm operation. Tamper Resist Feature – Unit will lock to mounting bracket to deter theft or tampering. cUL Listed. Package Dimension: 270.00x200.00x65.00mm or10.6x7.9x2.6in Package Weight: 0.40kg or0.0lbs.'),
    ('zn-shopro-3-ft-14-3-sjt-6-outlet-power-bar-surge-protector-white', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/products/13345-y13wfrtLV-9AlnaKPhw_800x.jpg?v=1677877451', '14/3 SJT. 15A/ 125V/1875 W. Integrated 15A circuit breaker. Surgerotector 300 joules. 6 outlets. Light on/off switch. Ideal for homes offices workshops or whereever you need multiple electrical outlets. Package Dimension: 310.00x120.00x50.00mm or12.2x4.7x2.0in Package Weight: 0.40kg or0.0lbs.'),
    ('zn-leviton-20a-gfci-combination-receptacle-type-a-usb-in-wall-charger-in-white', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/products/13344-cLjveDLqR-WOVKC24uB_800x.jpg?v=1677877448', 'The SmartlockPro Self-Test GFCI Combination Type A USB In-Wall Charger offers the trusted safety of Leviton GFCI protection with the advantage of powerful USB charging for Code-compliant use in kitchens bathrooms or anywhere GFCI protection is required. Engineered to meet the latest UL standard for auto-monitoring (self-test) Leviton GFCIs periodically conducts an automatic internal test to confirm that protected power is available. If the GFCI detects a problem 1 or more of the following will occur: power will be denied (trip with the inability to reset) trip with the ability to reset subject to the next auto-monitoring test cycle or repeatedly trip or visual and/or audible indication. For additional safety the device outlets feature tamper-resistant shutters that meet NE 406.12 requirements by blocking access to the contacts unless a 2 or 3 prong plug is inserted. Package Dimension: 165.00x110.00x80.00mm or6.5x4.3x3.1in Package Weight: 0.30kg or0.0lbs.'),
    ('zn-leviton-15a-decora-protection-usb-and-gfci-receptable', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/products/13343-4-9HiyR74-dWqlX2WnO_800x.jpg?v=1677877444', 'Rated: 4.8A (24w) usb charger 15A - 125v receptacle. USB ports offer powerful adapter-free charging for smartphones tablets and more. Self test feature helps ensure GFCI is providing protection (refer to chart on inside of box for power status/GFCI status/miswiring diagnostics. GFCI cannot be reset if miswired (Line/Load reversal only) or if protection is compromised. improved child safety-shutter mechanism inside outlet blocks access to the contacts from most foreign objects. For new construction and retrofit intallations extra deep electrical box (20 cu. in.) required. Use with decora wallplate or decora+ screwless wallplate sold separately. Package Dimension: 160.00x105.00x75.00mm or6.3x4.1x3.0in Package Weight: 0.25kg or0.0lbs.'),
    ('zn-power-adapter-for-gas-range-converts-220v-to-110v', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/products/13132-6K3cyBq7J-Kf2Ggw4DC_800x.jpg?v=1677877441', 'Plug location with 90 degree orientation allows for appliance to be closer to the wall. Has an easy-grip T-shape handle for easy and safe removal from the 250 V outlet. Plug configuration: 3-pole 4-wire grounding 125-Volt/250-Volt. Built-in fuse adds an overload safety feature. Outlet configuration: NEMA 5-15R (2-pole 3-wire grounding). 15 Amp 125-Volt (protected by non-replaceable 15 Amp fuse) Package Dimension: 135.00x110.00x85.00mm or5.3x4.3x3.3in Package Weight: 0.40kg or0.0lbs.'),
